n style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">材料科学与工程</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">张老师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">18220507206</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">纳米材料</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">纳米材料与技术</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">顾老师</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 18px;">15191439490</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0,